1.4.2 17/08/2017
! Reswitched Form type as there is a base adhrecord

1.4.1 17/08/2017
! Switched Form_File for Form_DB which was incorrect
! Missing DeleteRecord option in drugs list

1.4.0 13/01/2017
+ Switched to support new client module

1.3.0 01/11/2016 
+ Changed to limit to parent-specific encounters
+ Logic to determine if drug was active at timepoint
+ StartDateSummary and EndDateSummary actions display type/status if no date
+ Extended drug active logic to work with time range

1.2.1 08/02/2016
! Removed JS logging

1.2.0 10/12/2015
* Updated reports to use sections rather than encounters

1.1.1 24/09/2015
! Removed DateCreated action which duplicates that in clinicle/client

1.1.0 22/06/2015
+ Modified to work with new client module
+ New filter to hide inactive drugs
+ Separated 'Add drug button' into 'Add prescription drug' and 'Add OTC drug'
+ Improved two-pass dictionary loading with better terms
+ Autocomplete searches from beginning of terms
+ Moved two types of drugs into their own tabs
+ Moved readdrugs dictionary sources outside codebase
! Inactivate page was not updating the date or the reason

1.0.6 28/01/2015
+ Added extra option to inactivate reason

1.0.5 18/09/2014
* Renamed ModuleInstall Dictionary classes
+ Date recorded field added to drug table (based on the encounter date created)
! Removed extra setting in drug-patient-report
! Corrected dictionary setting to use headings
* Added 'data_type' settings to expression fields

1.04 25/03/2014
* modified to work with core v2
+ regression test examples added

1.03 10/02/2014
* changes to ensure compatibility with core 1.0.16
* changed field length for adherence average dose, changed range for no. collected to 0-100, added new drug frequency option

1.02 22/11/2013
Added OD to drug_frequency dictionary

1.01 22/10/2013
Moved adherence report option to top menu bar
Changed adherence date from create date to date of assessment

1.00 24/09/2013
Demerged separate medication module from investigation module
Added patient report to mediciation module with larger fonts and only active drugs.
Moved CopyActiveDrugs field class to med module.




